---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
---
<Base
  title="My Approach to Therapy | Shloka Iyer, LMFT"
  description="Relational, exploratory therapy drawing on existential and attachment-based perspectives. Conversational online sessions for adults across California."
>
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">My approach</p>
      <h1>Relational, exploratory, and grounded in how you make meaning</h1>
      <p class="lead">My work is relational and exploratory, with a focus on patterns, identity, and how past experiences continue to shape present responses.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--white section--line">
    <div class="wrap cols">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Method</p>
        <h2>How I work</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>I draw from existential and attachment-based perspectives, which means I often look at how you make meaning of your experiences and how you relate to others.</p>
        <p>At the same time, I incorporate elements of evidence-based practices when useful, not as rigid tools, but as ways to support clarity, decision-making, and change.</p>
        <p>Sessions are conversational and collaborative. Some are more exploratory, while others focus more directly on specific patterns or challenges.</p>
        <p>I tend to be direct when needed, and I also use humor where it feels appropriate. Therapy doesn't have to feel overly clinical to be meaningful, but it also doesn't become casual or unfocused.</p>
        <p>The goal is to create a space where you can think more clearly, understand yourself more honestly, and engage with your experiences in a way that feels intentional.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--line" id="how-therapy-works">
    <div class="wrap cols">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Process</p>
        <h2>How therapy works</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="prose">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">What to expect</h3>
        <p>Sessions are conversational. Some sessions are exploratory, while others focus on specific patterns or challenges.</p>
        <h3>Structure</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>No rigid worksheets or prescriptive exercises</li>
          <li>Occasional reflections between sessions</li>
          <li>Flexible structure based on your needs</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Therapy may include both exploration and gentle challenge, depending on what is most useful in the moment.</p>
        <p><a class="arrow-link" href="/guides/what-therapy-looks-like">Guide: what therapy looks like</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--white section--line">
    <div class="wrap cols">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Fit</p>
        <h2>Who this may not suit</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>This approach may not be the best fit if you are looking for highly structured, worksheet-based therapy or a strictly directive style.</p>
        <p><a class="arrow-link" href="/faq">Frequently asked questions</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand />
</Base>
